.TH SDL_GamepadConnected 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GamepadConnected \- Check if a gamepad has been opened and is currently connected.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gamepad.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_GamepadConnected(SDL_Gamepad *gamepad);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I gamepad
a gamepad identifier previously returned by
.BR SDL_OpenGamepad ()\[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true if the gamepad has been opened and is currently connected, or false if not\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

